WEBVTT

00:01:28.954 --> 00:01:31.262
in midtown Manhattan.

00:01:31.262 --> 00:01:35.387
This little space became a small phenomenon,

00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:38.255
and because it had such a profound impact

00:01:38.255 --> 00:01:39.471
on New Yorkers,

00:01:39.471 --> 00:01:43.555
it made an enormous impression on me.

00:01:43.555 --> 00:01:46.052
I studied this park very early on in my career

00:01:46.052 --> 00:01:47.638
because it happened to have been built

00:01:47.638 --> 00:01:49.416
by my stepfather,

00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:52.048
so I knew that places like Paley Park

00:01:52.048 --> 00:01:54.448
didn't happen by accident.

00:01:54.448 --> 00:01:57.000
I saw firsthand that they required

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.456
incredible dedication

00:01:58.456 --> 00:02:01.514
and enormous attention to detail.